# Treat these as binary - never line-ending-convert or diff as text. (No blanket
# `* text=auto` rule here on purpose - this repo already has tracked text files
# checked in with CRLF; retroactively renormalizing them would create a huge,
# unrelated line-ending-only diff. Just fix the actual binary-type misdetection.)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg -text
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.mcpb binary
*.ase binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
